# Files exempt from the "no upstream hosts" CI guard.
# gitignore-style path globs; one per line. Only tooling that intentionally
# references the upstream host to REWRITE it, migration provenance, and human
# documentation belong here. Application/runtime code must never be hand-added.

# Documentation legitimately names the upstream project and its hosts.
**/*.md
**/*.mdx

# --- Baseline-seeded (2026-06-20) ---------------------------------------------
# These files already carried upstream hosts from upstream engine code at
# rollout time. Allowlisting them keeps the guard green today AND lets future
# upstream merges into wycats-main land here without breaking CI. The guard
# still fails on NEW host refs in any other (patternyard) file. This list
# doubles as the known upstream-host debt inventory for this repo.
.env
.env.example
.github/workflows/node.js.yml
.vscode/settings.json
src/addons/pull.js
src/lib/pm-config.js
src/playground/index.ejs
static/privacy.html
static/terms.html
vercel.json
